 * goes stale after a rename.  Drives the REAL async Name dialogue flow:
 * EDITOR_KEY_NAME -> begin_set_name() -> editor_cb_request_input() ->
 * resolve_dialogue_submit() -> ... -> editor_system_dialogue_result() ->
